Package: gcloglog
Title: Functions for fitting models with the generalized complementary log-log function
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(person("Bert", "van der veen", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "bert_van_der_veen@hotmail.com"),
             person("Francis K.C.", "Hui", role = "aut"))
Description: The gcloglog package provides functionality for fitting a flexible link function in binomial regression based on a latent negative-binomial count. The original link function was proposed by Aranda-Ordaz (1981), and motivation via a negative-binomial latent count by van der Veen and Hui (in prep).
